  <ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock id="Tag238" contextRef="C1">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font style="background-color: #f5f5f5;"&gt;In 2026, the Company collected amounts from shippers related to the vacated Rehearing Order, 178 FERC 61,023.&amp;#160; As a result, the adjustment is considered distortive to current operating&amp;#160;revenue and has been recoded to Account 645, Unusual or Infrequent Items (Credit) in the amount of $1,061,397.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
